                        


Item #:  SCP-5127

Object Class:  Euclid

Special Containment Procedures:  SCP-5127 is being contained at Site-06-3 until the foreseeable future. No personnel should stand within 5 meters of SCP-5127 this is due to its anomaly. No special amenities are to be given to SCP-5127.

Description:  SCP-5127 is an anomalous object that resembles a wax figure of an unknown origin. SCP-5127 seems to be completely inanimate until it is approached by any living subject in 5 meters. If a living being enters the 5 meters seclusion zone SCP-5127 will become semi-conscious and will not return to its inanimate state until it has neutralized the subject. Attempts to interview SCP-5127 during its semi-conscious state but these attempts failed. All testing has been suspended.

                    

                                    





            
    

                    



                    
                        
                            
